{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35843","headline":"春日喜逢乡人刘松 · 李咸用","name":"春日喜逢乡人刘松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人不见五春风，异地相逢岳影中。\n旧业久抛耕钓侣，新闻多说战争功。\n生民有恨将谁诉，花木无情秪自红。\n莫把少年愁过日，一尊须对夕阳空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}